# buchong-824 pipeline

Minimal scripts for YOLO training, tiled prediction/visualization, and proliferating-cell segmentation/counting.

```bash
cd /data20T2/QMXdata/chang/yolo/buchong824_pipeline
python train.py --device 0
python predict.py --device cpu
python count.py
```

`predict.py` writes visualizations, proliferating-cell crops, and `detections.csv`. `count.py` writes every mask and count while marking uncertain results as `review_required`. See `README.CN` for details.
